# sgo.build (schema: see core/sgo.build). wata-fb is an APP over core + json +
# wataclient (the portable client core) that rides a cgo Go dep (sgola.example/
# audio, static opus/tinyalsa libs on a cgo cross-build).
# emitname is `fb` (the pre-6b shared-tree subdir .sgo/fb — the ci scripts
# reference it), while the module dir + binary are `wata-fb`.
mode app
emitname fb
binname wata-fb
gomod sgolafb
crosskey wata-fb
optreport
godep sgola.example/audio go-pkgs/audio cgo
